{'symbol': 'SWKS', 'date': '2022-11-17 02:01:00', 'title': "SKYWORKS AND SEQUANS INTRODUCE THE WORLD'S SMALLEST LTE-M/NB-IOT SYSTEM-IN-PACKAGE SOLUTION", 'text': "MUNICH--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SKYWORKS SOLUTIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: SWKS), AND SEQUANS COMMUNICATIONS S.A. (NYSE: SQNS), TODAY INTRODUCED THE SKY66431, A 5G MASSIVE IOT SIP (SYSTEM-IN-PACKAGE) SOLUTION. THIS NEXT-GENERATION SIP COMBINES SEQUANS' MONARCH 2 MODEM WITH SKYWORKS' INDUSTRY-LEADING RF FRONT-END SOLUTION, CREATING THE WORLD'S SMALLEST LTE-M/NB-IOT CONNECTIVITY PLATFORM IN A SINGLE PACKAGE."}